  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KRF Inclusive poilitical parties in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to responsive and inclusive political parties in Kenya. This program will also strengthen the capacity to participate in political processes specifically for women, youth and persons with disabilities. Outcome 1: Decision making processes within political parties are more inclusive and democratic. Outcome 2: Marginalized groups are better
represented in political processes in Kenya, including persons with disabilities (PWDs).</narrative>
  </description>
